==============================================================================
W2  Adjustment-cost asymmetry sweep (alpha+ / mc)
==============================================================================
The day-ahead position is the only thing risk aversion chooses, and it
is priced only through the deviation terms, so the benefit must scale
with alpha+. A monotone response is evidence the mechanism is the one
claimed rather than a numerical accident.
